* >Natural Source Header 000000
* :Mode S
* :CP
* :LineIncrement 10
* <Natural Source Header
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
* Version   3.5
* Function  Encode string with special char into named char
*           for OPO and NPR Unix
*
* Encodes a string with special characters of a given codepage into
* *CODEPAGE and replaces the special characters with HTML named char
* of format "&named-char;" and vice versa. Converts linefeeds of
* Windows, Unix and MAC-OS X into Unix Linefeeds H'0A'.
* Function 'T' does not allow a target codepage.
* Routine ignores single characters that cannot be converted (NAT3413)
*
* This routine checks for CP=OFF and ICU available and calls XXCPAGU or
* XXCPAGA depending of the result.
*
* fhi§SAG Sep 2014
*
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
*
* Maintenance
* -----------
* uuuuuu  yyyy-mm-dd iTrac       Remark
* fhi     2014-08-20 NOMALL-1454 created.
* fhi     2014-09-18 NOMALL-1454 Avoid square bracket as constant,
*                                adapt to NPR 2.1.5.1 and OPO 3.4.3
* fhi     2014-09-19 NOMALL-1454 Add trace statements
* fhi     2014-09-22 NOMALL-1489 NAT0001 in EXAMINE,partly rewritten
* fhi     2014-09-26 NOMALL-1491 Correct comm to OPO for OPO-51, no tags
* fhi     2014-09-29 NOMALL-1475 Correct pipe character coding
* fhi     2014-09-30 NOMALL-1475 Enhance trace, no tags
* fhi     2014-10-01 NOMALL-1475 same
* fhi     2015-03-25 NOMALL-1561 Handle line feeds correctly.
* fhi     2016-02-09 NOMALL-1632 same
* fhi     2016-04-04 NOMALL-1632 Always use U'...' literals in #STRING
*                                No tags
* SU1     2016-05-23 NOMALL-1851 ICU not active:return appr.msg
* fhi     2016-10-04 vOMALL-1930 trace strings with failed conversion
* fhi     2016-10-05 NOMALL-1930 Routine LOG-ERROR rewritten, no tags
* fhi     2016-10-31 NOMALL-1946 Get printable hex prints
* fhi     2016-11-03 NOMALL-1930 Don't throw a NOM0021 if conv-error.
* fhi     2016-11-04 NOMALL-1930 same
* fhi     2016-11-14 NOMALL-1930 Omit special chars in source, no tags
* fhi     2016-11-21 NOMALL-1962 Still wrong conversions
* fhi     2016-12-05 NOMALL-1962 same
* fhi     2016-12-12 NOMALL-1962 same
* SU2     2018-05-04             NAT ERR in LUW only in english
* fhi     2018-05-11 NOMALL-1918 Use XXMVENC for conversion
* fhi     2018-09-03 NOMALL-2125 Split XXCPAGE to alpha and unicode vers
* fhi                            Rewritten
* ----------------------------------------------------------------------
DEFINE DATA
*
PARAMETER
1 FUNCTION                         (A1) BY VALUE
*                                  /* 'E' Encode for OPO
*                                  /* 'D' Decode for OPO
*                                  /* 'T' Encode for NPR (trigraphs)
*                                  /* 'U' Decode for NPR (trigraphs)
1 STRING                           (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
1 ERC                              (I4) BY VALUE RESULT
*                                  /* return code:
*                                  /* 0=OK,
*                                  /* 1=Invalid function
*                                  /* n=Encoding error
1 ERT                              (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE RESULT
1 SRC-CP                           (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE OPTIONAL
*                                  /* Source-Codepage.
*                                  /* Only present in unicode environm.
*                                  /* Convert to *CODEPAGE before
*                                  /* execution
1 TAR-CP                           (A) DYNAMIC BY VALUE OPTIONAL
*                                  /* Target-Codepage.
*                                  /* Only present in unicode environm.
*                                  /* Convert to CODEPAGE after
*                                  /* execution
1 TRACE                            (L) BY VALUE OPTIONAL
*
1 USTRING                          (U) DYNAMIC OPTIONAL
*                                  /* Only present in unicode environm.
*                                  /* If specified: Use it instead of
*                                  /* STRING for input
************************************************************************
LOCAL
1 #CHCK-MOVE-U                     (U1) INIT <UH'20AC'> /* EURO char
1 #CHCK-MOVE-A                     (A4)
1 #ENC-ERC                         (I4)
1 #TRACING                         (L)
END-DEFINE
*
************************************************************************
* Main line
************************************************************************
*
*
* Set tracing
*
IF TRACE SPECIFIED
  #TRACING := TRACE
END-IF
RESET ERC ERT
OPTIONS TQMARK=OFF
SET GLOBALS CPCVERR=ON
/* Throw Nat error if codepage conversion fails. Will be set to OFF by
/* XXMVENC to get the destination string even after 3413 has occurred.
*
MOVE ENCODED #CHCK-MOVE-U TO #CHCK-MOVE-A IN CODEPAGE 'UTF-8'
  GIVING #ENC-ERC
/* Codepage UTF-8 exists on both, MF and Unix systems
IF #ENC-ERC NE 0 OR *CODEPAGE = ' '
  CALLNAT 'XXCPAGA'
    FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT 2X #TRACING
ELSE
  DECIDE FOR FIRST CONDITION
    WHEN    SRC-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING     SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT SRC-CP TAR-CP #TRACING USTRING
    WHEN    SRC-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING NOT SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT SRC-CP TAR-CP #TRACING
    WHEN    SRC-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING     SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT SRC-CP   1X   #TRACING USTRING
    WHEN    SRC-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING     SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT 1X     TAR-CP #TRACING USTRING
    WHEN    SRC-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING NOT SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT SRC-CP   1X   #TRACING
    WHEN    SRC-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING     SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT   2X          #TRACING USTRING
    WHEN    SRC-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP      SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING NOT SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT   1X   TAR-CP #TRACING
    WHEN    SRC-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND TAR-CP  NOT SPECIFIED
        AND USTRING NOT SPECIFIED
      CALLNAT 'XXCPAGU'
        FUNCTION STRING ERC ERT   2X          #TRACING
    WHEN NONE
      IGNORE
  END-DECIDE
END-IF
*
IF ERC = 3413 OR = -3413
  RESET ERC ERT  /* Don't pass a codepage error to the caller.
/*                  Has already been logged. That's all.
END-IF
*
* -------------------------- end main ----------------------------------
*
END
